  "segmentTimings": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "text": "今天想分享一个准备面试项目介绍的小方法，主要讲怎么让别人听懂你做了什么。",
      "purpose": "开场，可保留",
      "clipStartFrame": 0,
      "clipEndFrame": 292,
      "cueStartMs": 267,
      "cueEndMs": 9466,
      "ttsOriginalSampleRate": 22050,
      "ttsOriginalSamples": 202261,
      "ttsOriginalDurationMs": 9172.834467120181,
      "normalizedAudioSamples": 440297,
      "normalizedAudioDurationMs": 9172.854166666666,
      "segmentDurationMs": 9733.333333333334,
      "wavSha256": "17be1500fb06c7d2edbcc8c5ca5f362fb742f1a2612de76fd875603419e3aab9"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "text": "刚开始准备时，我总觉得材料越多越好，结果写着写着，连自己都找不到重点。",
      "purpose": "演示叙述，可删",
      "clipStartFrame": 292,
      "clipEndFrame": 561,
      "cueStartMs": 10000,
      "cueEndMs": 18433,
      "ttsOriginalSampleRate": 22050,
      "ttsOriginalSamples": 185508,
      "ttsOriginalDurationMs": 8413.061224489797,
      "normalizedAudioSamples": 403827,
      "normalizedAudioDurationMs": 8413.0625,
      "segmentDurationMs": 8966.666666666666,
      "wavSha256": "466f71bd5931aabd5a3ec29317b8157ea02b3e145c23b81325e7dad72e7382b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "text": "我建议先看岗位要求，再选择最相关的项目；如果岗位明确要求作品集，再优先准备项目展示。",
      "purpose": "条件与建议，整块处理",
      "clipStartFrame": 561,
      "clipEndFrame": 908,
      "cueStartMs": 18967,
      "cueEndMs": 30000,
      "ttsOriginalSampleRate": 22050,
      "ttsOriginalSamples": 242739,
      "ttsOriginalDurationMs": 11008.57142857143,
      "normalizedAudioSamples": 528412,
      "normalizedAudioDurationMs": 11008.583333333334,
      "segmentDurationMs": 11566.666666666666,
      "wavSha256": "29213199e0e4bbac47e695404a585b93cd8c07e3995c869b776db2d36293bf73"
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "text": "不是所有岗位都需要额外做一套作品集，也不是展示页面越多，别人就越容易理解。",
      "purpose": "否定与限定，整块处理",
      "clipStartFrame": 908,
      "clipEndFrame": 1182,
      "cueStartMs": 30534,
      "cueEndMs": 39133,
      "ttsOriginalSampleRate": 22050,
      "ttsOriginalSamples": 189275,
      "ttsOriginalDurationMs": 8583.900226757369,
      "normalizedAudioSamples": 412028,
      "normalizedAudioDurationMs": 8583.916666666666,
      "segmentDurationMs": 9133.333333333334,
      "wavSha256": "7e60af3b8a9b6f91ebe7d5f241d96dc1f72b3aeff6a0669a6dea3ba58080a635"
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "text": "可以先用三句话建立开头的结构：你解决了什么问题，你具体做了什么，结果有什么证据。这不是要求你把所有细节都塞进三句话里。",
      "purpose": "数字、结构与适用范围，整块处理",
      "clipStartFrame": 1182,
      "clipEndFrame": 1619,
      "cueStartMs": 39667,
      "cueEndMs": 53700,
      "ttsOriginalSampleRate": 22050,
      "ttsOriginalSamples": 308821,
      "ttsOriginalDurationMs": 14005.48752834467,
      "normalizedAudioSamples": 672264,
      "normalizedAudioDurationMs": 14005.5,
      "segmentDurationMs": 14566.666666666666,
      "wavSha256": "670de0a43103c080d79fbe015b5fdb609952881a501bd6d14dc5d20b091a0800"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "text": "先说问题，再说行动，最后说证据。其实换一种说法，就是把问题、行动和证据依次讲出来。",
      "purpose": "重复，可优先删",
      "clipStartFrame": 1619,
      "clipEndFrame": 1966,
      "cueStartMs": 54234,
      "cueEndMs": 65266,
      "ttsOriginalSampleRate": 22050,
      "ttsOriginalSamples": 242674,
      "ttsOriginalDurationMs": 11005.62358276644,
      "normalizedAudioSamples": 528270,
      "normalizedAudioDurationMs": 11005.625,
      "segmentDurationMs": 11566.666666666666,
      "wavSha256": "47d0a308f4f7a94713da1818eaab4adc43c7741f7f1d7f8999337421f301cf33"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "text": "比如介绍一个数据项目，可以先说原来哪一步很慢，再解释你改了哪一步，最后展示怎么比较。",
      "purpose": "例子，可选保留",
      "clipStartFrame": 1966,
      "clipEndFrame": 2273,
      "cueStartMs": 65800,
      "cueEndMs": 75500,
      "ttsOriginalSampleRate": 22050,
      "ttsOriginalSamples": 213844,
      "ttsOriginalDurationMs": 9698.14058956916,
      "normalizedAudioSamples": 465511,
      "normalizedAudioDurationMs": 9698.145833333334,
      "segmentDurationMs": 10233.333333333334,
      "wavSha256": "09efd5ab2ada17f6bdb8cd33267349d2e19d11fb9ef5a35f5b9cf556a118b829"
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "text": "我个人还会先选一个简单的文档配色，不过颜色只是整理习惯，不会替你回答项目问题。",
      "purpose": "题外细节，可删",
      "clipStartFrame": 2273,
      "clipEndFrame": 2569,
      "cueStartMs": 76034,
      "cueEndMs": 85366,
      "ttsOriginalSampleRate": 22050,
      "ttsOriginalSamples": 205630,
      "ttsOriginalDurationMs": 9325.62358276644,
      "normalizedAudioSamples": 447630,
      "normalizedAudioDurationMs": 9325.625,
      "segmentDurationMs": 9866.666666666666,
      "wavSha256": "770c4caaa44a7652fc9fad83ffa6b65fab017dabeeb2fe9426c123ccb789858e"
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "text": "项目介绍可以围绕问题、行动和证据展开，让听众先抓住主线。",
      "purpose": "对结构的重复，可优先删",
      "clipStartFrame": 2569,
      "clipEndFrame": 2814,
      "cueStartMs": 85900,
      "cueEndMs": 93533,
      "ttsOriginalSampleRate": 22050,
      "ttsOriginalSamples": 167658,
      "ttsOriginalDurationMs": 7603.5374149659865,
      "normalizedAudioSamples": 364970,
      "normalizedAudioDurationMs": 7603.541666666667,
      "segmentDurationMs": 8166.666666666667,
      "wavSha256": "9632e9c8cb12830f385829fd39c9de6e97058783ac6ee11b96427fd4a66f3cb2"
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "如果项目还没有正式上线，就清楚说明目前做到哪一步，不要把计划中的效果写成已经发生。",
      "purpose": "条件与事实边界",
      "clipStartFrame": 2814,
      "clipEndFrame": 3143,
      "cueStartMs": 94067,
      "cueEndMs": 104500,
      "ttsOriginalSampleRate": 22050,
      "ttsOriginalSamples": 229559,
      "ttsOriginalDurationMs": 10410.839002267574,
      "normalizedAudioSamples": 499721,
      "normalizedAudioDurationMs": 10410.854166666666,
      "segmentDurationMs": 10966.666666666666,
      "wavSha256": "e03a0c20e59b31f6caa8a8a97d00ab3504045d8161675cfec99b3a03bdc6b259"
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "text": "接着准备一个具体困难：当时有哪些选择，你为什么这么选，后来根据什么做了调整。",
      "purpose": "实用补充",
      "clipStartFrame": 3143,
      "clipEndFrame": 3435,
      "cueStartMs": 105034,
      "cueEndMs": 114233,
      "ttsOriginalSampleRate": 22050,
      "ttsOriginalSamples": 202574,
      "ttsOriginalDurationMs": 9187.02947845805,
      "normalizedAudioSamples": 440978,
      "normalizedAudioDurationMs": 9187.041666666666,
      "segmentDurationMs": 9733.333333333334,
      "wavSha256": "267bf6d8f632ffdf6161562bf8bf20bf63d13d33813b3486ab95b6cb7e22702c"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "text": "练习时可以录一遍，再听有没有重复或跳步。需要删短时，先删重复，再检查重要条件是否还在。",
      "purpose": "总结与任务呼应",
      "clipStartFrame": 3435,
      "clipEndFrame": 3788,
      "cueStartMs": 114767,
      "cueEndMs": 126000,
      "ttsOriginalSampleRate": 22050,
      "ttsOriginalSamples": 247684,
      "ttsOriginalDurationMs": 11232.834467120181,
      "normalizedAudioSamples": 539177,
      "normalizedAudioDurationMs": 11232.854166666666,
      "segmentDurationMs": 11766.666666666666,
      "wavSha256": "991fd65414a701b57c52bf30f5a34016db64dc38bb4baeaa9285ae5b61c8ae69"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "text": "所以，今天的方法可以概括为：根据岗位选项目，用清楚的结构解释，并且让结果有依据。",
      "purpose": "重复总结，可删",
